<p>This is the first half of my and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4176498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561409161" alt="Nameless Mediocre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4176498)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;">Nameless Mediocre</a></span>'s entry for the collaberation contest. As you can tell just by reading this, it's a collab between the Shark Punching Center and the Pattern Screamers.</p>
<p>I had the idea of using SCP X Pattern Screamer and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4176498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561409161" alt="Nameless Mediocre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4176498)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;">Nameless Mediocre</a></span> came up with the idea for the SCP itself (my origional idea had been a more direct reference to SCP-3930).</p>
<p>This was really a collaberation in every sense of the word. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4176498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561409161" alt="Nameless Mediocre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4176498)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;">Nameless Mediocre</a></span> did some last minute maintenance, got the audio logs and made the O5 email. I wrote the interview and the SPC email. The Description and discovery parts were a joint effort between us.</p>
